<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia unchanged at 1.872 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia unchanged at 1.872 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia was unchanged at 1.872 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange.</p>
